Hello,

I've recently made available a script that extracts video decoding
firmware from the blob without having to do mmiotrace/valgrind-mmt
traces. You can find out more about it on the
http://nouveau.freedesktop.org/wiki/VideoAcceleration/ wiki page,
along with the current support status for the various decoding
engines.

Happy video decoding!

